sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor Staff as 課外活動組老師
actor Officer as 社團幹部
participant ReviewUI as ReviewCenterBoundary<br/>&lt;&lt;Boundary&gt;&gt;
participant Review as ReviewController<br/>&lt;&lt;Control&gt;&gt;
participant Application as ActivityApplication<br/>&lt;&lt;Entity&gt;&gt;
participant Form as ApplicationFormBoundary<br/>&lt;&lt;Boundary&gt;&gt;
participant Controller as ApplicationController<br/>&lt;&lt;Control&gt;&gt;

Staff->>ReviewUI: 查看待審核申請
ReviewUI->>Review: review(id, targetStatus, note)
Review->>Application: validateTransition(待審核, target)

alt targetStatus = 已核准
  Review->>Application: changeStatus(已核准, "")
  Application-->>Review: ActivityApplication(status=已核准)
  Review-->>ReviewUI: 顯示審核結果
else targetStatus = 待補件 and note 不為空
  Review->>Application: changeStatus(待補件, note)
  Application-->>Review: ActivityApplication(status=待補件)
  Review-->>Form: 顯示補件原因
else targetStatus = 已退回 and note 不為空
  Review->>Application: changeStatus(已退回, note)
  Application-->>Review: ActivityApplication(status=已退回)
  Review-->>ReviewUI: 顯示退回結果
else targetStatus = 待補件或已退回 and note 為空
  Review-->>ReviewUI: reject(要求補件或退回時必須填寫原因)
  ReviewUI-->>Staff: 顯示原因必填錯誤；狀態維持待審核
end

loop status = 待補件、尚未取消且尚未成功重送
  Officer->>Form: 修改補件資料
  Form->>Controller: resubmit(id, revisedRequest)
  Controller->>Application: validate + clear note + revision++
  Application-->>Controller: ActivityApplication(status=待審核)
  Controller-->>Form: CreateResult(resubmitted=true)
  Form-->>Officer: 顯示重送成功，等待下一次審核
end

Note over ReviewUI,Controller: FR-08 的狀態集合、原因規則與終止語意仍待確認
